    <!-- Both engines run on every scan and the second one is slow: roughly
         95s measured, up to 160s. "A few seconds" set an expectation the
         server cannot meet, and an operator who thinks a scan has hung
         reaches for the back button on a request that was about to
         succeed. -->
    <string name="scan_processing_hint">Both readers are checking the label — up to two minutes</string>
